BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230718T021322Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nSleep\nSynopsis\n:\nLearn about the importance of qua
	lity rest for our overall well-being. Explore the science behind sleep cyc
	les\, the effects of sleep deprivation\, practical strategies for optimizi
	ng sleep habits\, and how proper sleep posture impacts the quality of rest
	. Discover how unlocking the power of a good night's sleep can enhance our
	 productivity\, mental health\, spinal health and overall quality of life.
	\nSpeakers\n:\nDr. Michelle CHEUNG (Raffles Medical)\, Dr. Audrey CHOH (Ch
	iroTherapy) and Yan Hong LEE\nJoining Instructions\n(In-Person)\n:\nDBS As
	ia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Marina Bay Financial Centre Tower 3\,
	 Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n \nJoi
	n via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\, you must fol
	low this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my.s
	harepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_
	0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. This will instal
	l Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming experie
	nce!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex Events U
	RL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e7716564ccfe56b67dbb7054a
	6f359fb0> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address and click
	 on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Webex Meetings A
	pp from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting & Input
	 Meeting Number: 2510 686 5933\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \nJoin via Pho
	ne (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (
	Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-011
	4 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2510 686 5933\nGlobal call-in number
	s <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e8b348588cbf111d8933d1b
	2e9c4a554e> \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230720T155000
